  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px;color:#fff;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-style:normal;font-weight:430;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid;font-weight:600\">G3装饰方块</strong></p>\n<p style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px;color:#fff;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-style:normal;font-weight:430;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span style=\"border:0px solid;background-color:oklab(0.999994 0.0000455678 0.0000200868 \\2f 0.0470588);font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;#x27;line-height:1;font-size:13px\">G3装饰方块</span> 是一款适用于 Forge 和 Neoforge 的装饰模组，专注于工业、科技、钢铁、石材、光效以及墙面类建筑方块。其目标是提供种类繁多的现代、科幻及工厂风格装饰方块，方便玩家在建造中自由使用与组合。</p>\n<p style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px;color:#fff;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-style:normal;font-weight:430;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">模组包含：</p>\n<ul style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px;color:#fff;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-style:normal;font-weight:430;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\n<li style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px\">工厂、钢铁、石材和科技方块套装</li>\n<li style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px\">动态光效方块与玻璃墙变体</li>\n<li style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px\">自定义霓虹灯牌系统，自带专属编辑器图形界面</li>\n<li style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px\">自定义&nbsp;<span style=\"border:0px solid;background-color:oklab(0.999994 0.0000455678 0.0000200868 \\2f 0.0470588);font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;#x27;line-height:1;font-size:13px\">方块切割机</span>&nbsp;用于将&nbsp;<span style=\"border:0px solid;background-color:oklab(0.999994 0.0000455678 0.0000200868 \\2f 0.0470588);font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;#x27;line-height:1;font-size:13px\">decor_base</span>制作成装饰方块</li>\n<li style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px\">支持 JEI 查看&nbsp;<span style=\"border:0px solid;background-color:oklab(0.999994 0.0000455678 0.0000200868 \\2f 0.0470588);font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;#x27;line-height:1;font-size:13px\">方块切割机</span>&nbsp;配方</li>\n<li style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px\">特殊装饰方块，如&nbsp;<span style=\"border:0px solid;background-color:oklab(0.999994 0.0000455678 0.0000200868 \\2f 0.0470588);font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;#x27;line-height:1;font-size:13px\">glow_line</span>、&nbsp;<span style=\"border:0px solid;background-color:oklab(0.999994 0.0000455678 0.0000200868 \\2f 0.0470588);font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;#x27;line-height:1;font-size:13px\">steel_ladder</span>、&nbsp;<span style=\"border:0px solid;background-color:oklab(0.999994 0.0000455678 0.0000200868 \\2f 0.0470588);font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;#x27;line-height:1;font-size:13px\">metal_barrel</span>、板条箱和储物盒</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"border:0px solid;line-height:22px;font-size:14px;color:#fff;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;#x27;font-style:normal;font-weight:430;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span style=\"border:0px solid;background-color:oklab(0.999994 0.0000455678 0.0000200868 \\2f 0.0470588);font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;#x27;line-height:1;font-size:13px\">G3装饰方块</span>&nbsp;专为创意建造、工业设施、实验室、走廊、面板墙和现代室内设计而打造。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
